<sync start=71080><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Problems threatening humanity！soil erosion, desertification of land,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　a variety of pollution, and global warming！remain prominent.</font>
<sync start=76660><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Problems threatening humanity！soil erosion, desertification of land,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　a variety of pollution, and global warming！remain prominent.</font>
<sync start=81030><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>As our globe has suffered from a multitude of disasters,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　it is high time that we！its inhabitants！stopped subjecting it to more catastrophic problems.</font>
